adventurers who call Qeynos home. If only one of them would take the time to help me with my er... [problem]..."},{"npc":"Sneed Galliway","text":"Ronn? I saw him a few days ago. He was with someone dressed in black I didn't recognize .. I think I saw them later that day, swimming in the north pond. They really should stay away from the aqueducts. They can be quite dangerous. Full of rats, ya know."},{"npc":"Merona Castekin","text":"Oh Tunare why!?!? Those foul Bloodsabers will pay for my brother's death!! Here. You have given us valuable information about a new threat to our homes. Take this a token of our appreciation."},{"npc":"Ronn Castekin's corpse","text":"Argh!.. Mer.. o..na.. it's.. not.. your fault.. arhhh.."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-07T08:57:52.699Z","outOfEra":false}
